# Only src/CCMC.Contracts and src/CCMC.Cloud.* plus their .csproj files are
# needed to build CCMC.Cloud.Api's Docker image (see Dockerfile) - everything
# else here is excluded to keep the build context small and to guarantee no
# WPF client code, test project, local database, or secret ever enters the
# image.

.git/
.vs/
.idea/

**/bin/
**/obj/

# Windows client + tests are not referenced by CCMC.Cloud.Api - never needed for this image.
src/CCMC.Desktop/
src/CCMC.Domain/
src/CCMC.Application/
src/CCMC.Infrastructure/
tests/

# Local/dev artifacts that must never enter the image.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.log
logs/
publish/
Doc/

# Development-only configuration containing a placeholder JWT secret and a
# local connection string - excluded from the build context entirely so it
# is never present in the image, in any environment. Production configuration
# comes ONLY from environment variables (ConnectionStrings__CcmcDb, Jwt__Secret,
# ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT) supplied at `docker run` / hosting-platform time.
src/CCMC.Cloud.Api/appsettings.Development.json

# Secrets / local env files - never committed, never shipped in an image.
.env
.env.*
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.local.json

# Repo docs not needed for the build.
*.md
